    "text": "Where do I start? Our Red Dog has been on Farmers Dog for over 2 years. He absolutely loves it. He’s 50 lb Red Heeler with tons of energy. I credit The Farmers Dog for his health and energy.\nNow for their customer service! Their caring, kindness and dedication for every single customer is something we need more of. They make it personal. Wether it’s a text, call or chat they take the time to hear you, answer simple questions or give suggestions. Last week I changed Reds food to the new Instant Fresh. I just got a follow up text from Evan checking on Red and his new food. He even wished Red a Happy Birthday for today. I’ll put The Farmers Dog in the column of “money well spent”. If you love your dog and you love service with a smile The Farmers Dog should be your go to!",
